  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wanghezhi:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wanghezhi:head:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDABB">王和之</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wanghezhi:head:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDABB">興道</persName>，琅琊人。祖翼，平南將軍。父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wanghezhi:head:m0020" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDAB">胡之</persName>，司州刺史。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-026-jin076-wanghezhi:head:m0028" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDABB">和之</persName>歷永嘉太守、正員常侍。</p>
</text>
